<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-48fdd456-c6db-8880-d29a-863b28741385"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font><span style="line-height: 18.3999996185303px;">{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you for your interest in the marriage and family therapy master’s program at the T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics. Please review the highly detailed Program Handbook at:</span><a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/sites/default/files/MASMFTHandbookMasterMay2014_0.pdf" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> program handbook</span></a><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> for information on the program courses, policies, procedures, timelines and more.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The yearly application deadline for this program is January 15</span><span style="vertical-align: super; white-space: pre-wrap;">th</span><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> but may be extended depending on applications. </span><a href="https://thesanfordschool.asu.edu/marriage-and-family-therapy/admissions" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Find out more</span></a><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> &nbsp;about the admissions procedures.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Once you have reviewed the handbook, please email </span><a href="mailto:gina.perez@asu.edu" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">me</span></a><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> with any questions you may have.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Submit an application today</span></a><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you and we look forward to hearing from you!</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Gina Perez</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Graduate Programs Coordinator</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">T. Denny Sanford School of Social and Family Dynamics</span></p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">480-965-6874</span></font></span>]]></td>
</tr>
